<div class="hub-faq-item">
<div class="hub-faq-q">What tests are at the NFL combine?</div>
<div class="hub-faq-a">The main athletic tests are the 40-yard dash (with 10 and 20-yard splits), vertical jump, broad jump, 3-cone drill, 20-yard shuttle and 225-pound bench press. Players are also measured for height, weight, arm length, hand size and wingspan.</div>
</div>
<div class="hub-faq-item">
<div class="hub-faq-q">What is a good RAS score?</div>
<div class="hub-faq-a">A Relative Athletic Score of 8.0 or higher is elite, and 9.0 or higher is exceptional. Most draft prospects score between 4.0 and 7.0.</div>
</div>
<div class="hub-faq-item">
<div class="hub-faq-q">What is the fastest 40 time at the NFL combine?</div>
<div class="hub-faq-a">The record is 4.21 seconds, set by Xavier Worthy in 2024.</div>
